#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:3
#: 49d1ea1d5d85408484e57d18059400f0
msgid "有限晶胞合金占位（Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy）"
msgstr "Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:5
#: 7a91d625c5e44d1d9860935c8da00cb6
msgid "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `FiniteCellAlloyOccupancyCard`"
msgstr "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `FiniteCellAlloyOccupancyCard`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:7
#: b830ea2b55314219ba586bde54ec8c64
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:9
#: 09759522d10c4740970c096a1d50c8ac
msgid ""
"按有限位点上真正可实现的整数计数生成合金占位。输入若含 "
"`atoms.arrays[\"sublattice\"]`，每个子晶格独立约束；普通结构则全部位点组成名为 `all` 的单一 site set。"
msgstr ""
"Generate alloy occupancies from integer counts that are actually realizable "
"on a finite set of sites. If the input contains "
"`atoms.arrays[\"sublattice\"]`, each sublattice is constrained "
"independently; otherwise all sites form one site set named `all`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:11
#: 0065be6c5e714ecba78c0f9989f144e6
msgid ""
"组成计划先确定每种元素的整数个数，再生成不重复的随机排布。卡片不会先采任意连续比例再静默取整，也不会把不可整除的目标写成 Exact。metadata "
"同时保存请求、实际计数、实际分数、composition ID 和 arrangement ID。"
msgstr ""
"A composition plan first fixes an integer count for every element, then "
"generates unique randomized arrangements. The card never samples an "
"arbitrary continuous fraction and rounds it silently, nor labels an "
"indivisible target as Exact. Metadata records the request, actual counts and"
" fractions, composition ID, and arrangement ID."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:13
#: fc43138f46a4425fae17084c04500d00
msgid "卡片主界面是可视化规则编辑器。先选择“全部位点”或“按子晶格”，再为每个位点集合添加元素，并选择一种组成模式。模式切换后只显示当前需要的比例或计数字段："
msgstr ""
"The main card UI is a visual rule editor. Choose All Sites or By Sublattice,"
" add elements to each site set, and select a composition mode. Changing "
"modes shows only the fraction or count fields that apply:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:15
#: 10a815a756354d87a147dcbf19adedfc
msgid "`fixed_fraction`：给出固定目标比例；可整除时记为 `exact`，否则采用确定性的最近整数计划并记为 `nearest_integer`。"
msgstr ""
"`fixed_fraction`: specify fixed target fractions. A divisible target is "
"marked `exact`; otherwise the card uses a deterministic nearest-integer plan"
" marked `nearest_integer`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:16
#: 05b52c1fcfaa4f2daf10316b83306720
msgid "`fraction_range`：枚举实际整数分数落在各元素范围内的计划。"
msgstr ""
"`fraction_range`: enumerate plans whose realized integer fractions fall "
"within each element's range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:17
#: 0e21a1996bad495c8cef78cb2d962b41
msgid "`count_range`：枚举各元素整数计数落在范围内且总和等于位点数的计划。"
msgstr ""
"`count_range`: enumerate plans whose integer counts fall within each "
"element's range and sum to the number of sites."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:19
#: bc9bfbe93d904e18ad3fe3b94ca01604
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:21
#: 30ecd1aed4914581b6ced717eaa9ff3b
msgid "场景：小晶胞 HEA 的“目标 20%”反复落到同一个实际组成"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: a nominal 20% target in a small-cell HEA repeatedly maps to the "
"same realized composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:23
#: cc3b56add21a485394693fbabf4d25a6
msgid "32 位点随机固溶体经过连续 Composition Sweep 后再取整，多个目标点可能都变成同一整数计数组合，训练集看似有很多组成，实际却重复。"
msgstr ""
"When continuous Composition Sweep targets are rounded on a 32-site random "
"solid solution, several target points can collapse to the same integer-count"
" combination. The training set appears compositionally diverse but actually "
"contains duplicates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:25
#: f894cd6da94b41d88e9b8e6563d489f8
msgid ""
"**输入：** 32 原子 A1/fcc 周期超胞。 **目标：** 直接枚举 Fe/Co/Ni 的可实现整数计数，并为每个组成生成 4 个不同排布。 "
"**参数设置：** `site_rules` 使用 `all`（若输入含 A 单子晶格则用 `A`）和 "
"`count_range`，给三种元素明确整数范围；`arrangements_per_composition=4`，固定 seed，设置 "
"`max_outputs`。 **输出：** 每个 composition ID 对应唯一整数计数组合；同一 composition 下的 "
"arrangement ID 不重复。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 统计 metadata 中的 `counts`，确认每帧总和为 "
"32、composition ID 无重复；重训时再按实际分数切片比较误差，而不是按原连续目标比例分组。"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** a periodic 32-atom A1/fcc supercell. **Goal:** enumerate "
"realizable Fe/Co/Ni integer counts directly and generate four distinct "
"arrangements for each composition. **Parameters:** use `all` in `site_rules`"
" (or `A` for an input with a single A sublattice), select `count_range`, and"
" give all three elements explicit integer ranges; set "
"`arrangements_per_composition=4`, a fixed seed, and `max_outputs`. "
"**Output:** each composition ID maps to a unique integer-count combination, "
"and arrangement IDs are unique within a composition. **How to verify "
"improved training-set quality:** aggregate the metadata `counts`, confirm "
"every frame sums to 32 and composition IDs are unique, then compare "
"retrained errors in slices based on realized fractions rather than the "
"original continuous targets."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:31
#: fbb8fbad775e4631896f1da9b909f42e
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:33
#: 2dd267dfd35d4643a2ccd1594a4d0707
msgid "位点划分与 Site Rules（site_rules）"
msgstr "Site partitioning and Site Rules (`site_rules`)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:35
#: c1eaea9dfd29493b974d6a33abbef7c8
msgid "默认界面使用“A/B 有序合金”模板，与默认的 Ordered Alloy Prototype 可直接连接："
msgstr ""
"The default UI uses the A/B Ordered Alloy template, which connects directly "
"to the default Ordered Alloy Prototype:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:37
#: de40c8b42f0d45a3b193ce8685895009
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\"A\":{\"composition\":{\"X\":1.0},\"elements\":[\"X\"],\"mode\":\"fixed_fraction\"},\"B\":{\"composition\":{\"X\":1.0},\"elements\":[\"X\"],\"mode\":\"fixed_fraction\"}}"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"{\"A\":{\"composition\":{\"X\":1.0},\"elements\":[\"X\"],\"mode\":\"fixed_fraction\"},\"B\":{\"composition\":{\"X\":1.0},\"elements\":[\"X\"],\"mode\":\"fixed_fraction\"}}"
"\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:41
#: 20cb16b4c0b54b32b2ff27bf65a11feb
msgid ""
"“普通单晶格合金”按钮会建立 `all` 规则；“A/B 有序合金”按钮会建立彼此独立的 A、B 规则。JSON 顶层 key 必须与输入的 site "
"set 完全一致。有 `sublattice` 时逐个编辑 A、B 等标签；没有时使用 `all`。卡片不会把 `all` 静默套到每个子晶格。"
msgstr ""
"The Single-Sublattice Alloy button creates an `all` rule; the A/B Ordered "
"Alloy button creates independent A and B rules. Top-level JSON keys must "
"match the input site sets exactly. Edit labels such as A and B individually "
"when `sublattice` is present; use `all` when it is not. The card never "
"applies `all` silently to every sublattice."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:43
#: b2a5edfe1d19438eb13b1ba941efd667
msgid ""
"规则仍处于初始占位状态时，载入上游结构会按实际标签自动匹配：普通无标签结构使用 `all`，A1/A2/A3 等单子晶格原型使用单独的 `A` "
"规则，L1₂/B2/L1₀ 保持 A/B。界面会明确提示自动匹配结果。只要用户编辑过规则、主动选择过模板、粘贴过 JSON "
"或载入过持久化参数，卡片就不再自动覆盖，标签不匹配时改为显示错误。"
msgstr ""
"While the rules are still in their initial placeholder state, loading an "
"upstream structure matches them to the actual labels automatically: an "
"unlabeled structure uses `all`, a single-sublattice A1/A2/A3 prototype uses "
"an `A` rule, and L1₂/B2/L1₀ keeps A/B. The UI reports the automatic match "
"explicitly. Once the user edits a rule, chooses a template, pastes JSON, or "
"loads persisted parameters, the card stops overwriting rules automatically "
"and reports label mismatches as errors."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:45
#: 77a25d98b0b6443eb03e86733f86d1d4
msgid ""
"输入结构可用后，界面会在对应规则旁显示实际位点数，并即时提示缺少标签、多余标签、非法/重复元素、范围错误和无整数解。底层持久化仍是 "
"`site_rules` 字符串；“高级：查看/粘贴 JSON”默认收起，可用于复制现有格式或粘贴旧配置。非法 JSON 不会覆盖当前有效的可视化规则。"
msgstr ""
"When an input structure is available, the UI shows the actual site count "
"beside each rule and immediately reports missing or extra labels, invalid or"
" duplicate elements, range errors, and infeasible integer plans. Persistence"
" still uses the `site_rules` string. Advanced: View/Paste JSON is collapsed "
"by default and can copy the current format or accept an older configuration."
" Invalid JSON never overwrites the current valid visual rules."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:47
#: 6fa2a42891794c37a559f309c3948e28
