"\n"
msgstr ""
"{\"A\":{\"elements\":[\"Fe\",\"Co\"],\"mode\":\"count_range\",\"counts\":{\"Fe\":[8,16],\"Co\":[8,16]}}}"
"\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:65
#: 7e166d26f86445b1b26bccafd74141fa
msgid "Arrangements per Composition（arrangements_per_composition）"
msgstr "Arrangements per Composition（arrangements_per_composition）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:67
#: 5d352b6f14ae4ed197ee6688c2097251
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个实际整数计数组合请求多少个不同的原子排布。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 1. The number of distinct atomic arrangements requested for "
"each realized integer-count combination."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:69
#: 5945c8f615694b0183abe87bc4113098
msgid "如果某个组成的理论唯一排布数小于请求值，只返回理论上存在的数量。例如两个位点各放一个 Fe/Co 只有 2 种排布，请求 10 也不会复制结果凑数。"
msgstr ""
"If a composition has fewer theoretically unique arrangements than requested,"
" only the realizable number is returned. For example, two sites occupied by "
"one Fe and one Co have only two arrangements; requesting ten does not "
"duplicate results to reach the requested count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:71
#: bf678dda325147f38a72d8a7e1e693f4
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Seed（use_seed）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:73
#: a9c053cab44141e6b198bee0f1fa08c5
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。开启后，组成预算抽样和每个组成的排布都由固定 seed 派生。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default true. When enabled, composition-budget sampling and each "
"composition's arrangements are derived from a fixed seed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:75
#: 7c2055dd121b43a89569745f48154085
msgid "组成可行域本身不随 seed 改变；seed 只决定超预算时选哪些计划以及元素落到哪些具体位点。"
msgstr ""
"The feasible composition domain itself does not depend on the seed. The seed"
" only determines which plans are selected when over budget and which "
"specific sites receive each element."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:77
#: 9eb7ef28e49541fc8fe1cdefb999dc2f
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr "Seed（seed）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:79
#: ba30405d44af4e92a1e64bbd3193fcd0
msgid "`int`，默认 0。固定随机路径的基础种子。"
msgstr "`int`, default 0. Base seed for the deterministic random path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:81
#: f2081b839ff14caaa798944744da4375
msgid ""
"生效条件：`use_seed=true`。相同输入、规则和 seed 会得到相同 composition/arrangement 顺序与占位；更换 "
"seed 时实际计数不变，但排布通常会改变。"
msgstr ""
"Applies when `use_seed=true`. Identical inputs, rules, and seed produce the "
"same composition/arrangement order and occupancy. Changing the seed does not"
" alter realized counts, but usually changes arrangements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:83
#: 013b7b15b7e647c9a66b42292f6e43b9
msgid "Max Outputs（max_outputs）"
msgstr "Max Outputs（max_outputs）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:85
#: 082f791a56924964bb30ae339466fae5
msgid "`int`，默认 200。单个输入结构最多返回的总结构数。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 200. Hard limit on the number of structures returned for one "
"input structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:87
#: c06ca6578eb0452cb9b5e2ce9383394e
msgid ""
"预算不足以覆盖全部组成时，operation 在整数计划索引空间中按固定步长确定性抽样，不依赖 Python "
"集合、目录或文件系统顺序。输入结构与规则都可用时，UI 直接调用 "
"`operation.estimate(...)`，显示各标签位点数、可行整数组成数、每组成请求排布数、截断前理论输出、`max_outputs`、预计实际输出和是否截断。没有输入时只提示先运行或载入上游结构，不显示伪精确数字。"
msgstr ""
"If the budget cannot cover every composition, the operation samples the "
"integer-plan index space deterministically at a fixed stride; it does not "
"depend on Python set, directory, or filesystem order. When both input "
"structure and rules are available, the UI calls `operation.estimate(...)` "
"directly and reports site counts by label, feasible integer compositions, "
"requested arrangements per composition, theoretical output before "
"truncation, `max_outputs`, estimated actual output, and whether truncation "
"occurs. Without input, it only asks the user to run or load an upstream "
"structure and never presents a spurious exact estimate."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:89
#: eaa1190f5f7f4135bc0dfe79877ea8d3
msgid "推荐预设"
