"    \"max_outputs\": 120\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:121
#: 5eabb2c93b164f53a61fbc5c7382f02c
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:123
#: 700bb18d4e734d63947e7b3b2f22ac9b
msgid ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`：覆盖 L1₂、B2、L1₀ "
"的有序和分子晶格无序占位。"
msgstr ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`: cover ordered and "
"sublattice-disordered occupancies for L1₂, B2, and L1₀."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:124
#: e72aa87531a847f3945841f9e52e9db8
msgid ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder → Super Cell → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`：普通 "
"FCC/BCC 结构没有 `sublattice` 时使用 `all` 单 site set 生成随机固溶体。"
msgstr ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder → Super Cell → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`: for "
"an ordinary FCC/BCC structure without `sublattice`, use the single `all` "
"site set to generate a random solid solution."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:125
#: e1c4f754ca1b4db8999267df85ec2105
msgid ""
"`Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy → Atomic Perturb → Lattice "
"Strain`：占位确定后再补坐标和晶格扰动；磁矩仍交给 Magnetic Order 或 Spin Disorder。"
msgstr ""
"`Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy → Atomic Perturb → Lattice Strain`: add "
"coordinate and lattice perturbations after occupancy is fixed; leave "
"magnetic moments to Magnetic Order or Spin Disorder."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:127
#: 7bf9c0cc76a44a66ad22a5778c772c09
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:129
#: c50f5041db4441b48bd6c441bf2aca15
msgid ""
"**提示 missing rules 或 unknown site sets。** 顶层 key 必须逐一匹配输入 `sublattice` "
"的实际标签；普通结构只能使用 `all`。operation 不会回退到 `group`。"
msgstr ""
"**The card reports missing rules or unknown site sets.** Every top-level key"
" must match an actual input `sublattice` label. An ordinary unlabeled "
"structure can use only `all`; the operation does not fall back to `group`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:131
#: be7c5ad4efa34f8bbfad12b982a8f84c
msgid "**提示没有整数解。** 各元素计数下限之和可能大于位点数，或上限之和小于位点数。分数范围也会先换算成当前晶胞可实现的整数边界，再检查总和。"
msgstr ""
"**The card reports no integer solution.** The sum of element count lower "
"bounds may exceed the number of sites, or the upper bounds may sum to less "
"than the number of sites. Fraction ranges are first converted to integer "
"bounds realizable by the current cell before the sum is checked."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:133
#: bd018191ccd44f40ab159ddf9f32e45d
msgid ""
"**输出少于 `arrangements_per_composition`。** 该组成的理论排布数已耗尽，或触发了 "
"`max_outputs`。这不是随机失败，卡片不会用重复排布伪造样本数。"
msgstr ""
"**Output is smaller than `arrangements_per_composition`.** The composition's"
" theoretically unique arrangements have been exhausted, or `max_outputs` was"
" reached. This is not a random failure; the card does not fabricate the "
"requested sample count with duplicate arrangements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:135
#: 2fc371019b7d48a7bd1153e162ab84ea
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:137
#: b07def3bb79f41f4866e07ffe788cdba
msgid ""
"`Config_type` 追加 "
"`FiniteAlloy(comp=<composition_id>,arr=<arrangement_id>)`。`finite_cell_alloy`"
" metadata 是 JSON 字符串，包含每个 site set 的实际 "
"`counts`、`fractions`、请求规则、实现状态、composition ID、arrangement ID 和派生 seed。"
msgstr ""
"`Config_type` appends "
"`FiniteAlloy(comp=<composition_id>,arr=<arrangement_id>)`. The "
"`finite_cell_alloy` metadata is a JSON string containing realized `counts` "
"and `fractions`, requested rules, realization status, composition ID, "
"arrangement ID, and derived seed for every site set."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:139
#: 0c3951b93c2b44eeb28a881703acb070
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:141
#: 7c568fdc96b1417e85ec2efe64f523c6
msgid "固定 `use_seed=true` 与 `seed` 后严格可复现。超预算组成抽样使用确定索引顺序；排布去重以逐位元素序列为准，不依赖集合迭代顺序。"
msgstr ""
"Runs are strictly reproducible with fixed `use_seed=true` and `seed`. Over-"
"budget composition sampling uses deterministic index order, and arrangements"
" are deduplicated by per-site element sequence without depending on set "
"iteration order."
